# forex-pytory

A Python library, CLI, and MCP Server for scraping economic calendars (ForexFactory, CryptoCraft, EnergyExch, MetalsMine).

## Installation

```bash
pip install -e .
```

## CLI Usage

```bash
forex-scrapper --source forex --date 2026-05-20 --format json
```
